      "h1": "Chimney Cleaning and Sweeping in Rockwall, TX",
      "introHtml": "<p>A clean chimney is one of the simplest ways to protect your home and enjoy your fireplace with confidence. Hearthguard Chimney Sweep Rockwall provides chimney cleaning for homeowners who want soot, creosote, and debris removed from the flue and firebox, along with honest feedback about the overall condition of their chimney.</p><p><a href=\"tel:4692736683\">Call (469) 273-6683</a> or <a href=\"/contact/\">request an estimate</a> to schedule your visit.</p>",
