    "rawHtml": "<section class=\"hero\">  <h1>Expert Chimney Sweep in Rowlett, TX</h1>  <p>Sitting along the western banks of Lake Ray Hubbard, Rowlett is a vibrant lakeside community where cozy hearth fires are a cherished winter comfort. Hearthguard Chimney Sweep offers Rowlett homeowners comprehensive chimney cleaning, leak troubleshooting, and certified safety inspections to keep your family protected and your fireplace operating at peak performance.</p>  <p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:[PHONE]\">Call [PHONE]</a> <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">Request an Estimate</a></p></section><section class=\"local-focus\">  <h2>Lakeside Weather and Chimney Wear in Rowlett</h2>  <p>Rowlett homes, particularly those in waterfront neighborhoods such as Waterview and Princeton Park, experience intense localized weather conditions. Persistent humidity off Lake Ray Hubbard, strong straight-line lake winds, and driving spring thunderstorms cause significant moisture wear on exterior chimney masonry.</p>  <p>When rainwater seeps into hairline cracks in your chimney crown or deteriorated mortar joints, it triggers spalling bricks and rusted fireplace dampers. Hearthguard brings dedicated local knowledge to every Rowlett chimney job, ensuring vulnerable water entry points are identified and sealed before moisture damages your ceiling or drywall.</p></section><section class=\"services\">  <h2>Our Professional Rowlett Chimney Services</h2>  <div class=\"service-cards\">    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Soot & Creosote Sweeping</h3>      <p>Clean flues burn hotter, cleaner, and without dangerous soot backups. Review our professional <a href=\"/chimney-cleaning/\">chimney cleaning</a> methods.</p>    </div>    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Multi-Point Flue Inspections</h3>      <p>We check interior flue liners, damper mechanisms, and chimney termination caps. Book your <a href=\"/chimney-inspection/\">chimney inspection</a>.</p>    </div>    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Masonry Waterproofing & Repair</h3>      <p>Defend against lakefront moisture with elastomeric crown coats and tuckpointing. Learn about our <a href=\"/chimney-repair/\">chimney repair</a> services.</p>    </div>  </div></section><section class=\"process\">  <h2>The Hearthguard No-Mess Sweep Process</h2>  <p>We know your time and home are valuable. Our clean, methodical sweeping process includes:</p>  <ol>    <li><strong>Room Preparation:</strong> Full perimeter drop cloth coverage protects your living room rugs, furniture, and hardwood floors.</li>    <li><strong>High-Velocity HEPA Filtration:</strong> Industrial vacuum units maintain continuous negative suction at the fireplace opening.</li>    <li><strong>Flue Scrubbing:</strong> Stiff mechanical brushes dislodge combustible soot and creosote along the entire chimney length.</li>    <li><strong>Firebox & Lintel Detailing:</strong> Complete vacuuming of the smoke shelf, throat damper, and refractory side panels.</li>    <li><strong>Safety Briefing:</strong> Clear explanation of our findings, accompanied by high-resolution digital photographs where repairs are indicated.</li>  </ol></section><section class=\"safety\">  <h2>Prioritizing Flue Safety in Rowlett</h2>  <p>According to safety literature from the <a href=\"https://www.csia.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chimney Safety Institute of America</a>, annual maintenance is essential to verify clear drafting passages and sound masonry. Creosote accumulation of just 1/8th inch is sufficient fuel to spark a dangerous chimney fire.</p></section><section class=\"faq\">  <h2>Rowlett Homeowner FAQs</h2>  <h3>How do I know if water is leaking into my chimney?</h3>  <p>Common symptoms include damp odors around the fireplace hearth, rusted firebox dampers, white powdery efflorescence on exterior bricks, and water spots on surrounding drywall or ceiling drywall.</p>  <h3>Can bad weather blow rain down my chimney?</h3>  <p>Yes. Missing, rusted, or improperly sized chimney caps allow rainwater to drop straight down the flue. We install durable stainless steel rain caps with animal mesh guards.</p></section><section class=\"cta\">  <h2>Schedule Your Rowlett Chimney Service Today</h2>  <p>Protect your investment and enjoy cozy fires with complete confidence. Call Hearthguard Chimney Sweep or request an online estimate today.</p>  <p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:[PHONE]\">Call [PHONE]</a> <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">Book Appointment</a></p></section>",
