    "rawHtml": "<section class=\"hero\">  <h1>Top-Rated Chimney Sweep in Wylie, TX</h1>  <p>Nestled between Lake Ray Hubbard and Lavon Lake, Wylie boasts historic charm, wonderful residential communities, and active families. Hearthguard Chimney Sweep provides Wylie homeowners with professional chimney cleaning, multi-point safety inspections, and dependable chimney repairs designed to keep your home warm and protected.</p>  <p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:[PHONE]\">Call [PHONE]</a> <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">Request an Estimate</a></p></section><section class=\"local-focus\">  <h2>Complete Chimney Care for Wylie Homeowners</h2>  <p>From historic homes near downtown Ballard Avenue to newer neighborhoods in Woodbridge, Twin Lakes, and Bozman Farm, Wylie properties showcase a variety of fireplace systems. Older masonry fireplaces often develop hairline cracks along the mortar crown or flue tile joints, while newer manufactured systems require routine checks on metal flue pipes and firebox panels.</p>  <p>Surrounded by two major reservoirs, Wylie residences experience elevated relative humidity and heavy wind-driven rain. Moisture remains the greatest enemy of any chimney system. Hearthguard delivers customized inspections and sweeps that identify moisture leaks, clear stubborn creosote, and optimize draft efficiency.</p></section><section class=\"services\">  <h2>Chimney & Fireplace Solutions in Wylie</h2>  <div class=\"service-cards\">    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Professional Chimney Sweeping</h3>      <p>Remove soot, ash, and dangerous creosote glaze from your flue walls. Explore our detailed <a href=\"/chimney-cleaning/\">chimney cleaning</a> services.</p>    </div>    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Comprehensive Flue Inspections</h3>      <p>Identify hidden structural cracks, liner separations, and damper leaks. Book an expert <a href=\"/chimney-inspection/\">chimney inspection</a>.</p>    </div>    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Chimney Waterproofing & Repair</h3>      <p>Resurface damaged crowns, replace rusted chase tops, and repoint mortar. Discover our <a href=\"/chimney-repair/\">chimney repair</a> craftsmanship.</p>    </div>  </div></section><section class=\"process\">  <h2>Our Hassle-Free Chimney Sweeping Process</h2>  <p>We believe in transparent communication, punctual arrivals, and immaculate cleanliness:</p>  <ol>    <li><strong>Home Preparation:</strong> Clean drop cloths and runner pads protect carpets, hardwood floors, and hearth stone.</li>    <li><strong>Soot Containment:</strong> Industrial-strength HEPA filtration systems maintain continuous suction to prevent airborne dust.</li>    <li><strong>Thorough Sweeping:</strong> Dual-direction mechanical brushes scrub every inch of the flue liner and smoke chamber.</li>    <li><strong>Damper & Shelf Cleanup:</strong> We remove soot and ash debris from behind the damper plate and vacuum the firebox clean.</li>    <li><strong>Findings Review:</strong> We share our observations, show you photo evidence of any issues, and answer all questions plainly.</li>  </ol></section><section class=\"safety\">  <h2>CSIA-Guided Safety Best Practices</h2>  <p>Our operational standards reflect recommendations from the <a href=\"https://www.csia.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chimney Safety Institute of America</a>. Routine annual sweeping ensures that toxic combustion byproducts, including carbon monoxide, vent safely outside your living space.</p></section><section class=\"faq\">  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions in Wylie, TX</h2>  <h3>How often should my chimney be swept in Wylie?</h3>  <p>If you use your wood-burning fireplace regularly during cold snaps, you should have it swept annually. Homes with gas log fireplaces should still be inspected yearly to verify clear venting.</p>  <h3>What causes white stains on my exterior chimney bricks?</h3>  <p>White powdery residue, known as efflorescence, occurs when water penetrates the brickwork and dissolves mineral salts. It is a clear warning sign of water intrusion that requires masonry sealing.</p></section><section class=\"cta\">  <h2>Book Your Wylie Chimney Service Today</h2>  <p>Ensure your fireplace is clean, efficient, and ready for chilly Texas evenings. Call Hearthguard Chimney Sweep or request an online estimate now.</p>  <p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:[PHONE]\">Call [PHONE]</a> <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">Schedule Today</a></p></section>",
