    "rawHtml": "<section class=\"hero\">  <h1>Dedicated Chimney Sweep in McLendon-Chisholm, TX</h1>  <p>Known for expansive acreage properties, tranquil equestrian estates, and custom rural architecture, McLendon-Chisholm is one of the most picturesque communities in Rockwall County. Hearthguard Chimney Sweep provides McLendon-Chisholm homeowners with expert chimney cleaning, detailed safety evaluations, and custom masonry repair to keep your heating systems operating safely season after season.</p>  <p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:[PHONE]\">Call [PHONE]</a> <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">Request an Estimate</a></p></section><section class=\"local-focus\">  <h2>Chimney Services Tailored for Custom Acreage Homes</h2>  <p>Homes in McLendon-Chisholm developments such as Sonoma Verde and Chisholm Crossing often feature grand custom hearths, high-ceiling masonry chimneys, and outdoor wood-burning fireplaces. These large hearth installations handle substantial firewood volumes, generating significant volumes of smoke, fly ash, and flammable creosote residue.</p>  <p>Furthermore, acreage properties face higher exposure to wildlife such as raccoons, squirrels, bats, and nesting swifts. An unprotected chimney cap or damaged spark arrestor can quickly allow unwanted animal visitors or dry windblown debris directly into your flue. Hearthguard provides specialized rural chimney inspections and robust animal-proof cap installations.</p></section><section class=\"services\">  <h2>Our Core Chimney Services in McLendon-Chisholm</h2>  <div class=\"service-cards\">    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Estate Chimney Sweeping</h3>      <p>Precision soot removal for large-scale wood-burning hearths and multi-story flues. Learn about our <a href=\"/chimney-cleaning/\">chimney cleaning</a> methods.</p>    </div>    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Comprehensive Flue Inspections</h3>      <p>In-depth video inspections examining flue tiles, crown caps, and structural mortar. Schedule a <a href=\"/chimney-inspection/\">chimney inspection</a>.</p>    </div>    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Custom Caps & Masonry Restorations</h3>      <p>Heavy-duty stainless steel spark arrestors and firebrick tuckpointing. Review our <a href=\"/chimney-repair/\">chimney repair</a> services.</p>    </div>  </div></section><section class=\"process\">  <h2>Our Professional Five-Step Protocol</h2>  <p>We respect your home and furnishings through meticulous containment practices:</p>  <ol>    <li><strong>Full Interior Protection:</strong> We position protective canvas drop cloths across the hearth and surrounding furniture.</li>    <li><strong>Soot Extraction System:</strong> Continuous HEPA filtration vacuums prevent ash from circulating into your living area.</li>    <li><strong>Mechanical Brushing:</strong> Flue cleaning with heavy-duty brushes tailored to masonry clay tile or stainless steel liners.</li>    <li><strong>Firebox & Smoke Shelf Clearing:</strong> Careful removal of all dislodged soot, creosote crust, and ash remnants.</li>    <li><strong>Comprehensive Post-Service Briefing:</strong> A detailed assessment explaining flue health, damper condition, and cap security.</li>  </ol></section><section class=\"safety\">  <h2>CSIA-Certified Safety Standards</h2>  <p>The <a href=\"https://www.csia.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chimney Safety Institute of America</a> recommends annual chimney inspections to identify hazardous creosote deposits, cracked flue liners, or compromised masonry joints before starting cold-weather fires.</p></section><section class=\"faq\">  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions in McLendon-Chisholm</h2>  <h3>Why are birds or critters entering my chimney?</h3>  <p>Open flues or damaged wire mesh allow birds and squirrels to nest inside. We install heavy-gauge stainless steel animal guards that protect your flue without restricting exhaust draft.</p>  <h3>Can you service outdoor patio fireplaces?</h3>  <p>Yes. We regularly inspect and sweep outdoor stone fireplaces, ensuring fireboxes and flues are clear of debris, spiderwebs, and leaves.</p></section><section class=\"cta\">  <h2>Book Chimney Care in McLendon-Chisholm Today</h2>  <p>Enjoy peaceful winter evenings by a safe, clean fire. Call Hearthguard Chimney Sweep or request your estimate online today.</p>  <p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:[PHONE]\">Call [PHONE]</a> <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">Get an Estimate</a></p></section>",
