    "rawHtml": "<section class=\"hero\">  <h1>Professional Chimney Sweep in Sunnyvale, TX</h1>  <p>Nestled just south of Lake Ray Hubbard, Sunnyvale is known for its spacious residential lots, quiet country atmosphere, and elegant custom homes. Hearthguard Chimney Sweep provides Sunnyvale homeowners with expert chimney sweeping, safety inspections, and chimney masonry repairs to guarantee safe, cozy winter evenings around the hearth.</p>  <p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:[PHONE]\">Call [PHONE]</a> <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">Request an Estimate</a></p></section><section class=\"local-focus\">  <h2>Fireplace Maintenance for Sunnyvale Properties</h2>  <p>Sunnyvale homes often feature striking stone and brick chimneys built with craftsmanship and quality materials. However, even the finest masonry requires maintenance. North Texas freeze-thaw cycles and severe summer thunderstorms take a toll on mortar crowns, metal chase flashing, and interior chimney liners.</p>  <p>When unseasoned oak or pecan wood is burned during sudden winter cold snaps, flammable creosote accumulates quickly on cold flue walls. Hearthguard delivers thorough cleaning and detailed inspections designed to keep your Sunnyvale fireplace drafting smoothly and burning safely.</p></section><section class=\"services\">  <h2>Our Sunnyvale Chimney Services</h2>  <div class=\"service-cards\">    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Chimney Cleaning & Sweeping</h3>      <p>Remove soot, ash, and dangerous creosote layers to restore safe draft velocity. Learn more about <a href=\"/chimney-cleaning/\">chimney cleaning</a>.</p>    </div>    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Certified Safety Inspections</h3>      <p>Detailed evaluations of clay liners, dampers, fireboxes, and crown masonry. Schedule a <a href=\"/chimney-inspection/\">chimney inspection</a>.</p>    </div>    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Flashing & Crown Repairs</h3>      <p>Stop water intrusion with crown resurfacing and professional tuckpointing. Discover our <a href=\"/chimney-repair/\">chimney repair</a> expertise.</p>    </div>  </div></section><section class=\"process\">  <h2>The Hearthguard Clean Commitment</h2>  <p>We believe in leaving your home cleaner than we found it. Our five-step sweep process includes:</p>  <ol>    <li><strong>Living Area Containment:</strong> Clean floor tarps and protective shields encase the hearth opening.</li>    <li><strong>Continuous HEPA Dust Extraction:</strong> High-volume vacuums trap fine soot particles at the source.</li>    <li><strong>Mechanical Flue Scrubbing:</strong> Stiff nylon or steel wire brushes clean the entire length of the flue.</li>    <li><strong>Smoke Chamber & Shelf Debris Removal:</strong> Thorough cleaning of the smoke shelf behind the damper.</li>    <li><strong>Clear Assessment:</strong> An honest review of chimney conditions, highlighting any necessary maintenance items.</li>  </ol></section><section class=\"safety\">  <h2>Adhering to CSIA Guidelines</h2>  <p>According to the <a href=\"https://www.csia.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chimney Safety Institute of America</a>, yearly evaluations are essential to detect hidden internal fractures and dangerous creosote accumulation that could lead to flue fires.</p></section><section class=\"faq\">  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions in Sunnyvale, TX</h2>  <h3>How do I know if my damper is stuck?</h3>  <p>If you feel resistance when turning the lever, or smoke billows into your living room upon lighting kindling, your damper may be rusted, off its tracks, or warped from heat. We lubricate and realign dampers during our visits.</p>  <h3>Can you fix cracked firebox mortar?</h3>  <p>Yes. We repoint damaged refractory mortar joints using heat-resistant refractory cement to prevent heat from transferring to adjacent framing.</p></section><section class=\"cta\">  <h2>Schedule Your Sunnyvale Chimney Sweep Today</h2>  <p>Prepare your fireplace for cold weather with reliable, certified service. Contact Hearthguard Chimney Sweep today.</p>  <p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:[PHONE]\">Call [PHONE]</a> <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">Schedule Service</a></p></section>",
