    "rawHtml": "<section class=\"hero\">  <h1>Trusted Chimney Sweep in Forney, TX</h1>  <p>Recognized as the Antique Capital of Texas, Forney is a thriving community combining rich historic roots with vibrant master-planned neighborhoods. Hearthguard Chimney Sweep provides Forney homeowners with comprehensive chimney cleaning, damper repair, and certified safety inspections to ensure your fireplace operates safely all winter long.</p>  <p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:[PHONE]\">Call [PHONE]</a> <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">Request an Estimate</a></p></section><section class=\"local-focus\">  <h2>Complete Chimney Care for Forney Neighborhoods</h2>  <p>Whether you reside in historic downtown Forney, Windmill Farms, Gateway Parks, or Fox Hollow, your fireplace requires periodic professional attention. Modern homes in Forney frequently feature zero-clearance prefabricated fireplaces with sheet metal chase surrounds, while older homes showcase traditional brick-and-mortar structures.</p>  <p>Both types of systems face North Texas weather hazards. Shifting soils can strain foundation alignments and pull exterior chimney structures away from rooflines, creating gaps where water leaks into attic spaces. Hearthguard offers local expertise to inspect your chimney structure, clear soot, and safeguard your household.</p></section><section class=\"services\">  <h2>Our Forney Chimney & Fireplace Services</h2>  <div class=\"service-cards\">    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Chimney Cleaning & Soot Removal</h3>      <p>Clean flue passages ensure strong draft and eliminate fire risks. Review our thorough <a href=\"/chimney-cleaning/\">chimney cleaning</a> methods.</p>    </div>    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Level 1 & Level 2 Inspections</h3>      <p>We check interior flue liners, damper gaskets, and exterior flashing seals. Book your <a href=\"/chimney-inspection/\">chimney inspection</a>.</p>    </div>    <div class=\"card\">      <h3>Flashing, Caps & Damper Repairs</h3>      <p>Prevent leaks and cold air drafts with custom caps and top-sealing dampers. Explore our <a href=\"/chimney-repair/\">chimney repair</a> services.</p>    </div>  </div></section><section class=\"process\">  <h2>The Hearthguard Clean-Home Procedure</h2>  <p>Our technicians take meticulous precautions to protect your home throughout every sweep:</p>  <ol>    <li><strong>Surface Safeguards:</strong> We roll out clean protective runners from your entrance to the fireplace hearth.</li>    <li><strong>Negative Pressure HEPA Vacuums:</strong> We create a continuous vacuum barrier at the firebox to trap microscopic soot particles.</li>    <li><strong>Rotary Sweeping:</strong> Thorough scrubbing of the flue interior from bottom to top, removing both soot and hard creosote.</li>    <li><strong>Smoke Chamber Cleanout:</strong> Sweeping ash and soot off the smoke shelf and lubricating damper pivot joints.</li>    <li><strong>Inspection Review:</strong> We provide you with a written assessment of your chimney's condition and answer any maintenance questions.</li>  </ol></section><section class=\"safety\">  <h2>NFPA Fire Prevention Standards</h2>  <p>The <a href=\"https://www.nfpa.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">National Fire Protection Association</a> standard NFPA 211 recommends annual inspection of all chimneys, fireplaces, and vents. Routine maintenance identifies soot buildup and cracked liners before they cause house fires or release dangerous carbon monoxide into your home.</p></section><section class=\"faq\">  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions in Forney, TX</h2>  <h3>What is a top-sealing damper?</h3>  <p>A top-sealing damper mounts on top of your chimney flue rather than inside the throat. It features a rubber gasket that seals tightly when closed, preventing cold drafts and rain from entering your chimney.</p>  <h3>Can you inspect a chimney before buying a home in Forney?</h3>  <p>Yes. We offer Level 2 real estate chimney inspections that provide home buyers with a clear, unbiased assessment of chimney integrity prior to closing.</p></section><section class=\"cta\">  <h2>Schedule Your Forney Chimney Sweep Today</h2>  <p>Don't wait for winter temperatures to drop. Contact Hearthguard Chimney Sweep today for dependable, professional fireplace service in Forney, TX.</p>  <p><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:[PHONE]\">Call [PHONE]</a> <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">Get an Estimate</a></p></section>",
